#
# +name      => creates a new library definition with no path info
# +name dir  => creates a new library definition with the library path directory
# -name      => this library is a dependent of the currently defined library
# @PHONY     => the currently defined library is tagged as being PHONY, the 
#               library does not exist but the name is used to group the dependent
#               libraries
# @LITERAL string => this string will be used to define the library during linking
#                    rather then using the automatic default

+vaxonly
  -FORTRAN
  -portlib
  -NETCDF
